abstract: >-
  Transcriptomics-domain DomainAdapters for the indicium ecosystem.
  v0.1.0 ships TranscriptomicsAdapter (bulk RNA-seq / microarray /
  time-series claims, repository-accession enrichment). A sibling
  SingleCellTranscriptomicsAdapter with CL + UBERON enrichment is
  scheduled for v0.2.0.
